OL,3,GNEWSAA6 roundabout revamp is wrong
OL,4,Apriority, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said it is a "mistake" to
OL,7,Fprioritise changes to a roundabout in
OL,8,FKibworth over two nearby junctions he
OL,9,Fbelieves require more urgent attention.
OL,11,FLeicestershire County Council plans to
OL,12,Fbegin work aimed at improving traffic
OL,13,Fflow at the Wistow Road roundabout next
OL,14,Fsummer and said the scheme was the
OL,15,Ffirst step in wider improvements along
OL,16,Fthe A6 in that area.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
