OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAA6 roundabout revamp is wrong
OL,4,Apriority, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Neil O'Brien, Conservative MP for
OL,7,FHarborough, Oadby and Wigston, said
OL,8,Flong waits and limited gaps in traffic
OL,9,Fmeant drivers were "taking their life
OL,10,Fin their hands" when joining the A6
OL,11,Ffrom the New Road and Church Road
OL,12,Fjunctions.
OL,14,FThe council said the Wistow Road
OL,15,Froundabout had been prioritised for
OL,16,Fwork following a review.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
